{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019re a circle. Everything else wants you gone.<br>But every time you die, you leave something behind \u2014 a glowing shield, a permanent upgrade, a memory of failure turned into a tool for survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Die. Upgrade. Try again.</strong><br>In this neon-lit bullet hell, every death creates a persistent upgrade that stays on the battlefield \u2014 blocking bullets, shaping new strategies, and gradually turning chaos into rhythm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a small, free game I made during a game jam.<br>I liked the vibe, so I decided to polish it up and share it here on Steam. It\u2019s short, weird, and (hopefully) satisfying. No microtransactions, no fluff \u2014 just you, the shapes, and the bullets.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Die. Respawn. Repeat.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3760890/a9b1517d0958b720ff65b65c8f622532917dd075.jpg"},{"name":"Respawn. Repeat.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3760890/a1d3b076e1fc5634c302c93cf48f1d020ea8d6a9.jpg"},{"name":"DLC. RSPWN. RPT.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3760890/a5eb24d18c5ecb9c2fc4c41a44dddbdb363014bb.jpg"},{"name":"DLC. NDTH.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3760890/60dbc50e6dea674b8d9e527b03f2ecdbc76c0d09.jpg"}],"total":4},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3760890?t=1749815492","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3760890?t=1749815492","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760890/e72bc6421598c2c50c09283d1910d5258aa5b96b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749815492","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760890/e72bc6421598c2c50c09283d1910d5258aa5b96b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749815492","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019re a circle. Everything else wants you gone.<br>But every time you die, you leave something behind \u2014 a glowing shield, a permanent upgrade, a memory of failure turned into a tool for survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Die. Upgrade. Try again.</strong><br>In this neon-lit bullet hell, every death creates a persistent upgrade that stays on the battlefield \u2014 blocking bullets, shaping new strategies, and gradually turning chaos into rhythm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a small, free game I made during a game jam.<br>I liked the vibe, so I decided to polish it up and share it here on Steam. It\u2019s short, weird, and (hopefully) satisfying. No microtransactions, no fluff \u2014 just you, the shapes, and the bullets.</p>","developers":["Artemii Frolov"],"dlc":[3760940],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760890/1d0aa9b912aafa7e5d4462f74cff1c9af7c8b245/header.jpg?t=1749815492","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Linux<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Intel 64-bit or Apple silicon<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.c